  "html_content": "<section class=\"page-hero\">\n<div class=\"wicm-container\">\n<h1>Our Store</h1>\n<p>Your one-stop shop for instruments, accessories, books, and more</p>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"page-content\">\n<div class=\"wicm-container\">\n\n<h2>Instruments</h2>\n<p>Our store carries a wide selection of instruments for musicians of all levels, from beginners to professionals. Whether you're picking up your first guitar or upgrading to a professional-grade kit, we have what you need.</p>\n\n<!-- GUITARS -->\n<div class=\"store-category\">\n<img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1510915361894-db8b60106cb1?w=900&h=400&fit=crop\" alt=\"Guitars on display at West Island Music Store\" class=\"store-category-img\" />\n<h3>Guitars</h3>\n<p>We stock an impressive range of guitars to suit every style and budget:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Classical Guitars</strong> &mdash; Perfect for classical repertoire, flamenco, and beginners. Nylon-string instruments offering warm, rich tone.</li>\n<li><strong>Electric Guitars</strong> &mdash; From solid-body to semi-hollow, guitars suited for rock, blues, jazz, and everything in between.</li>\n<li><strong>Bass Guitars</strong> &mdash; 4-string, 5-string, and fretless models for every genre and playing style.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"store-brands\">\n<h4>Our Brands</h4>\n<div class=\"brands-grid\">\n<a href=\"https://www.fender.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"brand-card\">\n<img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a0/Fender_guitars_logo.svg/200px-Fender_guitars_logo.svg.png\" alt=\"Fender\" class=\"brand-logo\" />\n<span>Fender</span>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.gibson.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"brand-card\">\n<img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/1e/Gibson_logo.svg/200px-Gibson_logo.svg.png\" alt=\"Gibson\" class=\"brand-logo\" />\n<span>Gibson</span>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.yamaha.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"brand-card\">\n<img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Yamaha_logo.svg/200px-Yamaha_logo.svg.png\" alt=\"Yamaha\" class=\"brand-logo\" />\n<span>Yamaha</span>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.ibanez.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"brand-card\">\n<img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ce/Ibanez_logo.svg/200px-Ibanez_logo.svg.png\" alt=\"Ibanez\" class=\"brand-logo\" />\n<span>Ibanez</span>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.taylorguitars.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"brand-card\">\n<img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/22/Taylor_Guitars_logo.svg/200px-Taylor_Guitars_logo.svg.png\" alt=\"Taylor\" class=\"brand-logo\" />\n<span>Taylor</span>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.epiphone.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"brand-card\">\n<img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f3/Epiphone_logo.svg/200px-Epiphone_logo.svg.png\" alt=\"Epiphone\" class=\"brand-logo\" />\n<span>Epiphone</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- DRUMS -->\n<div class=\"store-category\">\n<img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519892300165-cb5542fb47c7?w=900&h=400&fit=crop\" alt=\"Drum kit at West Island Music Store\" class=\"store-category-img\" />\n<h3>Drums &amp; Percussion</h3>\n<p>Complete drum kits, individual shells, cymbals, hardware, and percussion instruments. We carry acoustic and electronic drum sets for practice and performance.</p>\n<div class=\"store-brands\">\n<h4>Our Brands</h4>\n<div class=\"brands-grid\">\n<a href=\"https://www.pearldrum.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"brand-card\">\n<img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ab/Pearl_Drums_logo.svg/200px-Pearl_Drums_logo.svg.png\" alt=\"Pearl\" class=\"brand-logo\" />\n<span>Pearl</span>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.tama.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"brand-card\">\n<img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6a/Tama_drums_logo.svg/200px-Tama_drums_logo.svg.png\" alt=\"Tama\" class=\"brand-logo\" />\n<span>Tama</span>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.zildjian.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"brand-card\">\n<img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/15/Zildjian_logo.svg/200px-Zildjian_logo.svg.png\" alt=\"Zildjian\" class=\"brand-logo\" />\n<span>Zildjian</span>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.roland.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"brand-card\">\n<img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0e/Roland_logo.svg/200px-Roland_logo.svg.png\" alt=\"Roland\" class=\"brand-logo\" />\n<span>Roland</span>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.mapexdrums.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"brand-card\">\n<img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/13/Mapex_Drums_logo.svg/200px-Mapex_Drums_logo.svg.png\" alt=\"Mapex\" class=\"brand-logo\" />\n<span>Mapex</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- KEYBOARDS -->\n<div class=\"store-category\">\n<img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552422535-c45813c61732?w=900&h=400&fit=crop\" alt=\"Keyboards and digital pianos at West Island Music Store\" class=\"store-category-img\" />\n<h3>Keyboards &amp; Pianos</h3>\n<p>Digital pianos, synthesizers, MIDI controllers, and portable keyboards. Ideal for home practice, stage performance, and studio production.</p>\n<div class=\"store-brands\">\n<h4>Our Brands</h4>\n<div class=\"brands-grid\">\n<a href=\"https://www.yamaha.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"brand-card\">\n<img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Yamaha_logo.svg/200px-Yamaha_logo.svg.png\" alt=\"Yamaha\" class=\"brand-logo\" />\n<span>Yamaha</span>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.roland.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"brand-card\">\n<img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0e/Roland_logo.svg/200px-Roland_logo.svg.png\" alt=\"Roland\" class=\"brand-logo\" />\n<span>Roland</span>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.casio.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"brand-card\">\n<img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5a/Casio_logo.svg/200px-Casio_logo.svg.png\" alt=\"Casio\" class=\"brand-logo\" />\n<span>Casio</span>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.nordkeyboards.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"brand-card\">\n<img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/Clavia_DMI_AB_Logo.svg/200px-Clavia_DMI_AB_Logo.svg.png\" alt=\"Nord\" class=\"brand-logo\" />\n<span>Nord</span>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.korg.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"brand-card\">\n<img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Korg_logo.svg/200px-Korg_logo.svg.png\" alt=\"Korg\" class=\"brand-logo\" />\n<span>Korg</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- AMPLIFIERS -->\n<div class=\"store-category\">\n<img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1535587566541-97121a128dc5?w=900&h=400&fit=crop\" alt=\"Guitar amplifiers at West Island Music Store\" class=\"store-category-img\" />\n<h3>Amplifiers</h3>\n<p>Guitar amps, bass amps, and keyboard amplifiers in a range of sizes and power ratings. From practice amps for your bedroom to stage-ready combos and heads.</p>\n<div class=\"store-brands\">\n<h4>Our Brands</h4>\n<div class=\"brands-grid\">\n<a href=\"https://www.fender.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"brand-card\">\n<img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a0/Fender_guitars_logo.svg/200px-Fender_guitars_logo.svg.png\" alt=\"Fender\" class=\"brand-logo\" />\n<span>Fender</span>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.marshall.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"brand-card\">\n<img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/66/Marshall_Amplification_logo.svg/200px-Marshall_Amplification_logo.svg.png\" alt=\"Marshall\" class=\"brand-logo\" />\n<span>Marshall</span>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.boss.info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"brand-card\">\n<img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5e/Boss_logo.svg/200px-Boss_logo.svg.png\" alt=\"Boss\" class=\"brand-logo\" />\n<span>Boss</span>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.voxamps.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"brand-card\">\n<img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/69/Vox_logo.svg/200px-Vox_logo.svg.png\" alt=\"Vox\" class=\"brand-logo\" />\n<span>Vox</span>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.orangeamps.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"brand-card\">\n<img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/27/Orange_Music_Electronic_Company_logo.svg/200px-Orange_Music_Electronic_Company_logo.svg.png\" alt=\"Orange\" class=\"brand-logo\" />\n<span>Orange</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- BOOKS -->\n<div class=\"store-category\">\n<img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507838153414-b4b713384a76?w=900&h=400&fit=crop\" alt=\"Music books and sheet music at West Island Music Store\" class=\"store-category-img\" />\n<h2>Books &amp; Manuals</h2>\n<p>We stock an extensive selection of music books and instructional manuals covering all instruments and skill levels. Our collection includes:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Method books for guitar, piano, drums, bass, voice, violin, and more</li>\n<li>Music theory textbooks from beginner to advanced</li>\n<li>Sheet music collections and songbooks across all genres</li>\n<li>Sight-reading and ear-training workbooks</li>\n<li>Exam preparation books for RCM and other conservatory programs</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Can't find what you're looking for? We can special-order any title with fast delivery.</p>\n<div class=\"store-brands\">\n<h4>Our Publishers</h4>\n<div class=\"brands-grid\">\n<a href=\"https://www.halleonard.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"brand-card\">\n<img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/5/5a/Hal_Leonard_logo.svg/200px-Hal_Leonard_logo.svg.png\" alt=\"Hal Leonard\" class=\"brand-logo\" />\n<span>Hal Leonard</span>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.alfred.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"brand-card\">\n<img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/6/69/Alfred_Music_logo.svg/200px-Alfred_Music_logo.svg.png\" alt=\"Alfred Music\" class=\"brand-logo\" />\n<span>Alfred Music</span>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.henle.de\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"brand-card\">\n<img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3e/G._Henle_Verlag_logo.svg/200px-G._Henle_Verlag_logo.svg.png\" alt=\"Henle Verlag\" class=\"brand-logo\" />\n<span>Henle Verlag</span>\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.rcmusic.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"brand-card\">\n<img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/49/Royal_Conservatory_of_Music_logo.svg/200px-Royal_Conservatory_of_Music_logo.svg.png\" alt=\"Royal Conservatory\" class=\"brand-logo\" />\n<span>Royal Conservatory</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- RENTALS -->\n<div class=\"store-category\">\n<img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511379938547-c1f69419868d?w=900&h=400&fit=crop\" alt=\"Instrument rentals at West Island Music Store\" class=\"store-category-img\" />\n<h2>Instrument Rentals</h2>\n<p>Not ready to buy? Our rental program lets you try an instrument before committing to a purchase. Rentals are available for most instruments and are ideal for students just starting out or for those who want to explore a new instrument. Rental fees can be applied toward a future purchase.</p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- REPAIRS -->\n<div class=\"store-category\">\n<img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558618666-fcd25c85f82e?w=900&h=400&fit=crop\" alt=\"Instrument repair workshop\" class=\"store-category-img\" />\n<h2>Repairs &amp; Maintenance</h2>\n<p>Our experienced technicians provide professional instrument repair and maintenance services, including:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Guitar setups, restringing, and fret work</li>\n<li>Drum head replacement and hardware repair</li>\n<li>Keyboard and electronics troubleshooting</li>\n<li>General instrument cleaning and maintenance</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Bring your instrument in for a free assessment and quote.</p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- VISIT US -->\n<h2>Visit Us</h2>\n<p>Come browse our store in person at our Pointe-Claire location. Our knowledgeable staff are happy to help you find the right instrument, book, or accessory for your needs.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/contact/\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Contact Us</a></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>"
}